:''For other uses, see [[Akane (disambiguation)]].''
'''Akane Tendo''' is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Ranma 1/2 Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 10.4 Update|Version 10.4]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Akane Tendo
|image = E 543.png
|money drop = 2,000¢ - 7,900¢
|appearance = [[Ranma 1/2 Collaboration Event]]
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has below average health and attack power, but has slightly above average range and movement speed. Her abilities are a 50% chance to do a [[Savage Blow]], along with a [[Long Distance]] attack that can reach up to 650 range. However, she has a long attack rate and somewhat fast attack animation, along with above average movement speed.

==Strategy==
Not a lot of units are able to outrange Akane Tendo's maximum [[Long Distance]] range, but many units can invade her blind spot. [[:Category:Rusher-class Cats|Rusher]] units like [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Swimmer Cat]] or [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Express Cat]] can do this well. Because of her somewhat long attack rate, even some low ranged units like [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Hip Hop Cat]] and/or [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime Cat]] can get to her if timed well.

